cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fjc-biographies in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fjc-biographies: Downloads and parses the FJC Biographical Directory of Article III Federal Judges"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that downloads the Federal Judicial Center's Biographical
  Directory of Article III Federal Judges, turns it into tidy tables, and
  builds a roster of judges by appointment and by judge, with fields coded
  from their careers, their names written for matching, and optional
  Judicial Common Space and Martin-Quinn scores.
authors:
